0, "text": "With you, I\u2019m free, in endless ways."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Ginger liqueur, in my heart and words,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "I dance, I sing, like flying birds."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[ outro ]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}